# The gate's fixed sequence (docs/39-oneplus-6t.md §8.1), played into
# phone-paint by PHONE_PAINT_PLAY (paint/src/play.rs): the same keys and
# touches for every GPU path and screen size, so their tables compare.
# The Shell starts it from the idle screen with no screen lock; apps are
# started cold (the kit and host.sh start the phone's Shell afresh).

wait sys.idle 90000
sleep 1000

# Main menu: open it, move the focus over the grid.
key enter
wait sys.menu
key right 3
key down 2
key left 3
key up 2

# Contacts: scroll the list with the keys, then with a finger.
open contacts
wait com.phone.contacts/list 10000
key down 15
key up 15
drag 50% 75% 50% 25% 250
drag 50% 25% 50% 75% 250
key enter
key esc
key f4
wait sys.idle

# Messages: a new SMS typed on the 9-key pad, then erased (no draft left).
key enter
wait sys.menu
open messages
wait com.phone.messages/list 10000
key down 3
key f2
wait com.phone.messages/new
type 13800000000
key down
type 4433555555666
key 0
type 9666777555
key backspace 16
key up
key backspace 11
key esc
wait com.phone.messages/list
key f4
wait sys.idle

# Settings: its sub-pages in and out.
key enter
wait sys.menu
open settings
wait com.phone.settings/root 10000
key enter
wait com.phone.settings/g.device
key enter
wait com.phone.settings/about
key down 5
key esc
wait com.phone.settings/g.device
key esc
wait com.phone.settings/root
key down 10
drag 50% 75% 50% 30% 250
key last
key enter
wait com.phone.settings/
key esc
key first
key f4
wait sys.idle

# Gallery: the grid and a photo or two.
key enter
wait sys.menu
open gallery
wait com.phone.gallery/list 10000
key right 2
key down 2
key enter
key right 2
key left 2
key esc
key f4
wait sys.idle
